- **Hg(s):** \( \text{Hg}^{2+} + 2\text{H}_2\text{S} \rightarrow \text{Hg(s)} + 2\text{H}_2\text{O} \) (Prepsates as solid Hg.)  
- **Mn(s):** \( \text{Mn}^{2+} + 2\text{H}_2\text{S} \rightarrow \text{Mn(s)} + 2\text{H}_2\text{O} \) (Prepsates as solid Mn.)  

