- Total B = 25 (from strand 1) + 20 (from strand 2) = 45
- Total C = 30 (from strand 1) + 25 (from strand 2) = 55
- Total T = 22 (from strand 1) + 30 (from strand 2) = 52

Thus, the total number of each base in the double-stranded DNA molecule is:
