Now, we can calculate the standard enthalpy change:

ΔH = -392 kJ/mol - [(-340 kJ/mol) + 2(-381 kJ/mol)]
ΔH = -392 kJ/mol - (-340 kJ/mol - 762 kJ/mol)
ΔH = -392 kJ/mol - (-1102 kJ/mol)
ΔH = -392 kJ/mol + 1102 kJ/mol
ΔH = 710 kJ/mol

