   \[
   \inf \frac{\nabla f(x^+) (y - x^+)}{||y - x^*|} \geq 0.
   \]  
   This implies that:  
   \[
   \nabla f(x^+) (y - x^+) \geq 0 \quad \text{for all } y \text{ close to } x^+.
   \]  
