1. $\cos (180^{\circ} + \alpha) = -\cos \alpha$
2. $\sin (\alpha + 360^{\circ}) = \sin \alpha$
3. $\sin (-\alpha - 180^{\circ}) = -\sin (\alpha + 180^{\circ}) = -(-\sin \alpha) = \sin \alpha$
