   \text{total mugs} = \text{optical mugs} + \text{turnwheel mugs} + \text{wired mugs}
   \]
   \[
   \text{total mugs} = 20 + 20 + \text{writeings mugs} = 80
   \]
   \[
   \text{writeings mugs} = 80 - 20 - 20 = 40
   \]

3. **Calculate the ratio of wireless mice to total mice:**  
   \[
   \text{ratio} = \frac{\text{waring mugs}}{\text{total mugs}} = \frac{40}{80} = \frac{1}{2}
   \]

