Calculate the average radiation dose to the liver if 1.6 kg of liver tissue absorbs 0.12 J of energy from a radiopharmaceutical.,"<bos><start_of_turn>user
Calculate the average radiation dose to the liver if 1.6 kg of liver tissue absorbs 0.12 J of energy from a radiopharmaceutical.<end_of_turn>
